  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be a polynomial of degree <math><mn>5</mn></math> such that <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> are its critical points. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then which one of the following is not true?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "RHCNP",
      "text": "<math><mi>f</mi></math> is an odd function",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fBvCY",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> . <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is a point of maximum and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WJCgr",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>is a point of local minimum and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is a point of local maximum",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "m9tqS",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is a point of local maxima of <math><mi>f</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>Consider,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Differentiating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Critical points of the function are given as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Solving both we get,&nbsp;<math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, local minima at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and local maxima&nbsp;at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>",
